  "7517615348951465984": {
   "created": 1792339169,
   "author": "Bassam Mejlaoui \ud83d\udca1(Sam J)",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bassam-mejlaoui_10000-to-work-on-your-side-project-and-activity-7517615348951465984-5Pb1",
   "text": "$10,000 to work on your side project and the \"valuation\" is $1B.\n\nIt's called Z Fellows\n\nWhat you get:\n\n\u2022 $10K investment at a $1B valuation cap\n\u2022 1 week with founders of Netflix, Figma, Vercel, DoorDash and more\n\u2022 A cohort of just 10 builders\n\u2022 Help for the life of your company, not just that week\n\nWhat you don't need:\n\n\u2022 A company (they'll help you set one up)\n\u2022 A co-founder\n\u2022 To quit your job or drop out\n\u2022 To live in the US\n\nAlumni include founders of Cursor, Cognition and Etched, who joined before anyone knew their names.\n\nThe condition: you're a technical builder working on something real.\n\nNo deadline. Rolling applications, all ages, open worldwide.\n\nBookmark it and send it to the frie",
