   "text": "Daily AI Brief ranks 10 private AI chip companies by their latest reported valuation.\n\nEtched is listed at $21B, SambaNova at $11B and Positron AI at $5B.\n\nAlso on the list: Groq, Tenstorrent, Rebellions, d-Matrix, FuriosaAI, Tensordyne and Unconventional AI.\n\nRead more: https://lnkd.in/gF5xZcbc\n\n\ud83d\udcf0 Subscribe to the weekly Silicon Brief Newsletter: https://lnkd.in/ejfzg92J\n\n#ai #artificialintelligence #ainews #aichips #datacenters",
