  "7517940804431028224": {
   "created": 1792416764,
   "author": "Agent Native",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/agent-native-dev_ai-chip-companies-dont-hire-like-chip-companies-activity-7517940804431028224-DTSL",
   "text": "AI chip companies don't hire like chip companies anymore.\n\nThe AI chip companies on our board have 243 open roles. \n\nMost sit at four companies: Cerebras (75), Etched (45), Graphcore (38) and FuriosaAI (26).\n\nThe split is what stands out:\n- 53% are software: inference cloud, compilers, kernels, runtime, infrastructure\n- 17% are chip design and validation: RTL, verification, physical design, silicon\n\nMore than three software roles for every silicon role. \n\nThe reason is that a chip sells when real models run fast on it, on day one, without the customer rewriting their stack.\n\nNvidia proved this as CUDA was built for years before anyone cared, and that software layer is what every challenger i",
   "disc_score": 3,
