   "author": "SFPlayground",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sfplayground_sfplayground-industrialai-manufacturing-activity-7518016753315176448-upky",
   "text": "Last Thursday, SFPlayground brought together founders, investors, engineers, and operators at The Cove in San Francisco for our Industrial AI Summit: The Future of Manufacturing. \ud83c\udfed\ud83e\udd16\n\nFrom AI-powered CAD and automated quality inspection to intelligent procurement and supply chains, the opportunity isn\u2019t simply to automate individual tasks. It\u2019s to connect traditionally fragmented engineering and manufacturing workflows, reducing the time, cost, and complexity of bringing physical products from concept to production.\n\nBut unlike software, physical AI must contend with real-world constraints: reliability, precision, manufacturability, and the cost of failure. The companies that solve these chal",
